chrissy teigen and john legend have lost  their baby  following pregnancy complications the 34  year old who announced she was expecting  baby number three with her husband  in august was hospitalized over the  weekend  and shared the heartbreaking news with  fans on instagram wednesday night  posting several tear-filled pics from  the hospital room  including this shot of her and john  holding their son  quote we are shocked and in the kind of  deep pain you only hear about  the kind of pain we've never felt before  chrissy added that they were never able  to stop her bleeding  and couldn't give their baby the fluids  he needed  despite having multiple blood  transfusions  something she kept her fans updated on  along the way  so i had my first blood transfusion  which sounds so much more dramatic than  it is  it's just like an iv but except  not fluids it's  human blood the model also explained  that while they waited to name their  first two children  four-year-old luna and two-year-old  miles until after they were born  they already had a name picked out for  their third  quote for some reason had started to  call this little guy in my belly jack  so he will always be jacked to us jack  worked so hard to be a part of our  little family  and he will be forever to our jack i'm  so sorry that the first few moments of  your life were met with so many  complications  that we couldn't give you the home you  needed to survive we will always love  you  chrissy ended her post thanking fans for  their support  adding quote on this darkest of days we  will grieve  we will cry our eyes out but we will hug  and love each other  harder and get through it later chrissy  shared an emotional tweet  writing driving home from the hospital  with no baby  how can this be real while john simply  wrote quote  we love you jack chrissy's posts were  met with  overwhelming support from fans and some  of her famous friends  including kim kardashian who wrote quote  we are  always here for you and love you guys so  much  gabrielle union who has suffered several  miscarriages of her own  echoed kim in the comments writing we  love you guys  so much and we will be here for whatever  y'all need  always paris hilton wrote that her heart  breaks for the couple  while channing tatum told chrissy he is  sending so much love  you
 

